## 4. Single Decision Card — Generation Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant DS as Data Layer
    participant MSM as Merchant State Machine
    participant PB as Playbook Engine
    participant PE as Policy Engine
    participant LLM as LLM Bouncer
    participant DC as Decision Card
    participant AL as Action Log

    DS->>MSM: Compute signals (RFM, overdue_ratio, inventory)
    MSM->>MSM: Update dimension state (HEALTHY to CRITICAL)
    MSM->>PB: Retention dimension DEGRADING
    PB->>PB: Match pattern — load Playbook YAML
    PB->>PE: Evidence + Playbook rules
    PE->>PE: Check margin floor, inventory gate
    PE->>DC: action_type=DISCOUNT, policy_passed=True
    DC->>DC: Classify RECOMMENDATION or HYPOTHESIS
    Note over DC: Product-level data = RECOMMENDATION<br/>Dept/Global data = HYPOTHESIS
    DC->>LLM: Decision Card + evidence
    LLM->>LLM: Gate 1 Schema valid
    LLM->>LLM: Gate 2 Policy consistent
    LLM->>LLM: Gate 3 No raw numerics
    LLM->>LLM: Gate 4 No banned phrases
    LLM->>LLM: Gate 5 Grounding verified
    LLM->>DC: Merchant-facing copy appended
    DC->>AL: Log to Action Log (shadow mode)
    AL-->>LLM: Future training signal (Bandit reward)
```

